  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID-19: Responsive COVID-19 Vaccines for Recovery Project under the Asia Pacific Vaccine Access Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support the procurement and delivery of safe and effective vaccines against COVID-19 through APVAX&apos;s RRC in compliance with ADB&apos;s vaccine eligibility criteria to the country. It aims to finance the procurement of about 15.9 million doses of vaccines, which will be administered to about 6.8 million Nepalese by 2024, with data collected and disaggregated by sex and age.</narrative>
  </description>
